      "line_end": 26,
      "title": "New delete endpoints have no tests",
      "description": "The change adds two deletion endpoints with auth and error paths. No test exercises either endpoint. Regressions in the authorization check or the purge error handling would ship unnoticed. Add tests covering non-admin rejection, unknown ids, and the purge removed count.",
